### Document Control

This policy establishes the requirements for granting, modifying, reviewing, monitoring, and revoking access to Gallery Holdings' information assets and technology resources.

The policy is maintained by the Information Security Team and is subject to formal review at least annually or when significant changes occur to the organization's business operations, technology environment, regulatory obligations, or information security risks.
